      "side": 1,
      "message": "vendor reply as below,\n`````````````````````````````\nIf use the register 0x53 to disable INT, it might affect the signal of interrupt pin.\nTherefore, we recommend using the mapping register 0x58 instead.\nYou can store the 0x58 register value in a variable then unmask data ready, FIFO watermark, FIFO full to disable interrupt features.\nIf you want to enable interrupt features, please restore the variable value to register 0x58.\n`````````````````````````````",
